.mt-6.prose
  :markdown
    The fork tracks `main`; there is no separate gem release, which is why
    the `Gemfile` points at Git. Upgrading means `bundle update
    rails_mini_profiler` and, if the schema changed, re-running the install
    migrations — the project is pre-1.0 and does not ship upgrade
    migrations.

